    "p1": "Michlifen is a stunning volcanic caldera located in the Middle Atlas mountains, renowned as Morocco's premier ski and winter sports destination. Surrounded by lush cedar forests and soaring peaks, it transforms into a snowy wonderland during winter and a lush alpine escape in summer.",
